{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29154","headline":"酬河中杜侍御重寄 · 许浑","name":"酬河中杜侍御重寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"五色如丝下碧空，片帆还遶楚王宫。\n文章已变南山雾，羽翼应抟北海风。\n春雪预呈霜简白，晓霞先染绣衣红。\n十千沽酒留君醉，莫道归心似转蓬。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29154.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29154","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}